{"code":"E3","wikidata":"Q6633167","wikipedia":{"en":"Nana BTS station","th":"สถานีนานา"},"summary":{"en":"Nana station is a BTS skytrain station, on the Sukhumvit Line in Khlong Toei and Watthana Districts, Bangkok, Thailand. The station is on Sukhumvit Road at Soi Sukhumvit 9, east of Nana intersection (Soi Sukhumvit 3). It is surrounded by a variety of hotels and facilities for foreign tourists.","th":"สถานีนานา เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าบีทีเอสแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสุขุมวิท ยกระดับเหนือถนนสุขุมวิทบริเวณใจกลางแหล่งธุรกิจท่องเที่ยวและสถานบันเทิงย่านนานา ในพื้นที่เขตวัฒนาและเขตคลองเตย กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"1999-12-05","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/BTS_Nana_Skytrain_Station.jpg/960px-BTS_Nana_Skytrain_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_Nana_Skytrain_Station.jpg","author":"Michael Coghlan","license":"CC BY 2.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Back_on_Sukhumvit_Rd_%2817675636658%29.jpg/960px-Back_on_Sukhumvit_Rd_%2817675636658%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Back_on_Sukhumvit_Rd_(17675636658).jpg","author":"Michael Coghlan from Adelaide, Australia","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/BTS_Nana_Station_NightShot_-_panoramio.jpg/960px-BTS_Nana_Station_NightShot_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_Nana_Station_NightShot_-_panoramio.jpg","author":"likeacat","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/BTS_Nana_Station.jpg/960px-BTS_Nana_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_Na